  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "You owe the House. Pay the DEBT before your SPINS run out, or the trapdoor opens.\r\n \r\n1. PICK A COLOR\r\n   Red or Black pays 2x. Green (the single 0) pays 36x.\r\n \r\n2. SET YOUR BET\r\n   Use - and + (steps of 10) or ALL IN, then press SPIN.\r\n \r\n3. BANK YOUR CHIPS\r\n   DEPOSIT moves chips into the ATM. The ATM pays the debt,\r\n   earns interest after every spin and is safe from bad bets.\r\n \r\n4. PAY THE DEADLINE\r\n   When the ATM covers the debt, it is paid at once.\r\n   Every spin you did not need gives you +10 chips.\r\n   Out of spins? You can still deposit to pay.\r\n \r\n5. SURVIVE\r\n   Each deadline the debt grows and the wheel spins faster.\r\n   From deadline 3, purple CURSED pockets pay nothing.\r\n \r\nHow far can you get before the House wins?"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a823c0711f71eb54c803972c3759f227, type: 2}
